OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA rather cloudy day across the
OL,6,Feast and central parts, with some
OL,7,Fpatchy light rain appearing, focused
OL,8,Feast of the A68. However staying dry
OL,9,Fin the west, with brighter spells
OL,10,Fbuilding across Dumfries and Galloway
OL,11,Ffor the afternoon. Winds light.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FEast remaining cloudy with
OL,14,Ffurther patchy light rain. West dry
OL,15,Fwith clear spells. Risk of frost and
OL,16,Fthe fog patches, chiefly to rural
OL,17,Fparts.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
