OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FSettled, largely dry fare
OL,6,Fwith bright and sunny spells
OL,7,Fincreasing, but early mist and fog may
OL,8,Fbe slow to burn back. Winds light.
OL,9,
OL,10,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,11,FPatchy light rain possible in Lothian
OL,12,Fand Borders, while Dumfries and
OL,13,FGalloway stays dry and occasionally
OL,14,Fbright. Moderate easterly breezes.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
